Z||000005||88 Fiero||10-20-1999||06:53 PM||||Richard...have you thought of contacting either Suspension Techniques and Eibachs Co...I used to have an ST springs with my '85 and I love it.. I'm not saying don't buy from the Fiero Store.. Question is that how do they make their springs...Compare to ST and Eibach, this companies makes this springs everyday and you can rely on their products...That's my opinion...||||reg||1
Z||000006||Eddie||10-20-1999||07:18 PM||||I know one thing for fact that is that cut springs are soft.And if I am wrong please tell me I think lowering springs are stiff and will not bottom out as much if they do at all.<BR>	 ||||reg||4
